title: Proposition 31
---
order: 31
---
short_label: VII.31
---
sections:

#### prop_section ####
kind: proposition
----
statement: Any composite number is measured by some prime number.
----
proof:

Let {A} be a composite number.

I say that {A} is measured by some prime number.

